## Program Outcome

The hosted dashboard retains and presents bounded semantic metric changes with honest measurement
context and exports exactly the allowlisted active projection.

## M1-CHANGE-HISTORY — Preserve semantic changes, not heartbeats

Status: active
Depends on: none

Outcome: Persist deduplicated Work Efficiency observations with explicit source context and bounded
retention.

Gate:

- `G1-CHANGE-ONLY-TREND-HISTORY`: semantic duplicate suppression, retention cap, freshness, epoch
  boundaries, and no permanent heartbeat stream.

Candidate campaign: `implement-dashboard-operational-trends-and-bounded-exports`.

## M2-TRENDS-AND-EXPORT-WORK2 — Present and qualify trustworthy views

Status: active
Depends on: M1

Outcome: Provide bounded windows, explicit coverage/comparability context, and capped CSV/JSON
exports of exactly the filtered on-screen projection.

Gates:

- `G2-TRUTHFUL-TREND-SEMANTICS`: coverage, sample window, freshness, reset/epoch, platform/version,
  and explicit unknown or incomparable states are visible.
- `G3-BOUNDED-VIEW-EXPORT`: schema-versioned, generated-at, capped, allowlisted, filter-faithful
  CSV/JSON exports pass privacy and browser checks.

Candidate campaign: `implement-dashboard-operational-trends-and-bounded-exports`.

