## Work2 Boundary

Work2 includes change-only history, retention, bounded trend and export implementation, focused
deduplication/privacy/filter/export/rendering tests, quick changed-path validation, scoped product
commit, deployment to the combined `ts.rookaro.com` target, authenticated browser and health
checks, release-cohort registration, checkpoint/rebuild proof, and strict Doctor.

Work2 does not push Git, tag or publish a version, introduce a BI platform, or close the Idea, Map,
PRM, or Campaign. Those await formal Work5 release evidence and reconciliation.
